WEBVTT

00:04:57.466 --> 00:05:00.349
Tuliamua kujenga muundo

00:05:00.349 --> 00:05:03.148
utakao punguza kwa kiwango kikubwa

00:05:03.148 --> 00:05:05.604
gharama ya elimu ya juu

00:05:05.604 --> 00:05:07.743
na hivyo ndivyo tulifanya.

00:05:07.743 --> 00:05:10.639
Kwanza, matofali na chokaa ni gharama.

00:05:10.639 --> 00:05:13.033
Vyuo vikuu vina matumizi

00:05:13.033 --> 00:05:16.423
ambayo vyuo vikuu vya mtandao havina.

00:05:16.423 --> 00:05:18.223
Hatuitaji kupasha gharama hizi

00:05:18.223 --> 00:05:19.939
kwa wanafunzi wetu.

00:05:19.939 --> 00:05:21.309
Hazipo.

00:05:21.309 --> 00:05:24.343
Pia hatufai kubabaishwa na uwezo.

00:05:24.343 --> 00:05:26.552
hakuna mipaka ya viti

00:05:26.552 --> 00:05:28.951
kwa vyuo vikuu vya mtandao.

00:05:28.951 --> 00:05:30.695
Hakika, hakuna anayeitaji kusimama